device: emulator-5558 | build: 8f2eb548

payment_webview_failure_helper.dart:12
  static const String endpoint = '/payment-mobile';
...passed verbatim as AppLogger.failure(..., endpoint: endpoint) on BOTH callbacks.

But selectedUrl is only /payment-mobile on the CHECKOUT path
(payment_webview_screen.dart: selectedUrl = baseUrl + '/payment-mobile?...').
  - wallet path       : selectedUrl = widget.addFundUrl
  - subscription path : selectedUrl = widget.subscriptionUrl

MEASURED on device, wallet add-fund path, via the webview's own DevTools endpoint
(adb forward tcp:9222 localabstract:webview_devtools_remote_<pid> -> /json/list):
  URL: http://10.0.2.2:8000/payment/razor-pay/pay?payment_id=REDACTED

=> a wallet/subscription gateway failure would be logged as endpoint=/payment-mobile,
   naming an endpoint that was never requested. PII-safe, but misdirects triage.
   AC3 asks for a PII-safe log line, which this is; the endpoint VALUE is the defect.

